    "### 1.2 Column types\n",
    "\n",
    "**What this cell does**: separates **numeric** columns (numbers: surface, year, number of rooms…) from **categorical** columns (text labels: neighborhood, roof type…).\n",
    "\n",
    "**Why**: machine-learning models only understand numbers. Numeric columns can be used almost directly; categorical columns must be **converted to numbers** (we do that in Part 3). Knowing which is which is the first step."
