    "# Part 7 — Which features matter?\n",
    "\n",
    "Two complementary views:\n",
    "- **Lasso coefficients**: green = increases price, red = decreases it (after scaling, so sizes are comparable). Features whose coefficient is 0 were discarded by Lasso.\n",
    "- **Gradient Boosting importance**: how much each feature was used to reduce errors across all the trees.\n",
    "\n",
    "Note that these are **correlations learned by the model, not proofs of cause**: e.g. `QualSF` combines quality and size, so it can \"share\" credit with `OverallQual` and `GrLivArea`."
   ]
  },
