    "# What next? Ideas to improve further\n",
    "1. **More diverse models** in the ensemble: XGBoost, LightGBM, CatBoost (`pip install xgboost lightgbm`).\n",
    "2. **Stacking** (`StackingRegressor`): instead of a fixed average, a small model learns how best to combine the others.\n",
    "3. **More feature engineering**: interactions between neighborhood and size, target-based neighborhood statistics (carefully, inside CV).\n",
    "4. **Better outlier handling**: remove houses with huge cross-validated errors.\n",
    "5. **Always test one idea at a time** and keep it only if the CV score improves."
